# Placeholder secrets for the elastic fixture's dev env.
# dev/test always run on the fixed foundation (per the doctrine), so these
# are consumed by docker-compose via the aggregate, not SSM.
#
# Engine-managed env vars are NOT declared here: POSTGRES_PASSWORD is
# `kind: minted` (docex mints it into infra/tte/dev.env) and POSTGRES_USER is
# `kind: fixed` (inlined at compile). Listing either — or the compile-resolved
# POSTGRES_DB/HOST — would collide with the TTE store during aggregation.
